   <div id=\"ucEfloraHeader_panelSearchBox\">\r\n\t\t\t <!-- begin of search box -->\r\n        <FORM name=\"formSearchBox\" action=\"browse.aspx\" method=\"get\">\r\n          <TABLE borderColor=\"#ccffcc\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"2\" width=\"200\" border=\"1\">\r\n            <TR>\r\n              <TD>\r\n                <span id=\"ucEfloraHeader_lblSearchBox\"><INPUT TYPE='Hidden' NAME='flora_id' ' id='flora_id' VALUE='120' >\n&nbsp;<input id=name_str name=name_str &nbsp;  value=''  class=small title='Use % as the wildcard\r\n(e.g. pinus % or pinus a%)'  onfocus='jsClearTextBox(this);' accessKey=s size=15> <input class=small type=submit value=Search name=btnSearch><br>\n <input name=chkAllFloras type=checkbox   > <span class=small>All Floras &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<A HREF='search_page.aspx?flora_id=120'  TARGET='_top'  class='a.link.small'>Advanced Search</A></span>\n</span></TD>\r\n            </TR>\r\n          </TABLE>\r\n        </FORM> <!-- end of search box -->\r\n      \r\n\t\t</div>\r\n    </TD>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n</TD>\r\n      </TR>\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD id=\"tdSubHeader\">\r\n<table id=\"FooterTableOut\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <TD>\r\n      <table bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" id=\"footerTable\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n        <tr>\r\n          <td style=\"WIDTH: 291px\"></td>\r\n          <TD align=\"right\">\r\n            <span id=\"ucEfloraSubHeader_lblLinks\"><a target='_top' href='/login.aspx'>Login</a>\n | <A HREF='/index.aspx'  TARGET='_top' >eFloras Home</A> | <A HREF='/help_page.aspx'  TARGET='_top' >Help</A></span></TD>\r\n        </tr>\r\n      </table>\r\n    </TD>\r\n  </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td bgcolor=\"#999999\"><img src=\"~/images/layout/dot.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"100%\" height=\"1\"></td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</TD>\r\n      </TR>\r\n      <TR>\r\n        <TD id=\"tdBody\">\r\n          <table id=\"tableBody\" cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n            <tr>\r\n              <td id=\"tdLeftBar\" valign=\"top\" width=\"0\"></td>\r\n\r\n              <td id=\"tdContent\" vAlign=\"top\" width=\"1930\">\r\n                <table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n                  <tr>\r\n                    <td vAlign=\"top\">\r\n                      <table id=\"tableTaxonChain\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n\t<tr>\r\n\t\t<td><span id=\"lblTaxonChain\"><font size=\"2\"><A HREF='flora_page.aspx?flora_id=120'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='Flora homepage' >Russian Ornamental</A> | <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=120'  TARGET='_top' >Family List</A> | <A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=10335'  TARGET='_top' >Fabaceae</A> <A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=120&start_taxon_id=10335'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='lower taxa' ><img border='0' src='images/layout/icon-list.gif'></A></font></span></td>\r\n\t</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n                      <P></P>\r\n                      <div id=\"panelTaxonTreatment\">\r\n\t\r\n                        <span id=\"lblTaxonDesc\"><!-- Default Template -->\r\n<b>Astragalus</b> L.\n<p>Milk Vetch \n<p>Астрагал  \r\n<P>\r\n\r\n<P>\r\n<Image:Begin>\r\n<TABLE cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"4\" width=\"200\" align=\"right\" bgColor=\"#ffffcc\" border=\"1\" >\r\n<TR>\r\n  <TD>\r\n    <A HREF='object_page.aspx?object_id=47948&flora_id=120' ><IMG SRC='http://www.mobot.org/MOBOT/research/russia/images/Fig_076.jpg' \n\twidth=200 border=0 >\n</A><A HREF='florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=102978'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='Treatment' >Astragalus</A><p align='right'>\n<SMALL class='font-color:purple'>Credit: Tatyana Shulkina</SMALL>\n<br>\n\r\n  </TD>\r\n</TR>\r\n</TABLE>\r\n<Image:End>\r\n<P>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\nAbout 2000 species on every continent except Australia, mainly in the temperate regions of the Northern Hemisphere; in the FSU flora - about 850 species, mainly in Central Asia and the Caucasus.  Among them are annual, biennial and perennial herbs, subshrubs and shrubs.  There are many cushion and mat-forming plants (<i>A. chionanthus</i> M. Pop., <i>A. stipitatus</i> Benth. ex Bunge).  Some plants are tall (<i>A. sieversianus</i> Pall. is 150 cm high) and very attractive when flowering or fruiting.  Most species are mountain xerophytes and can grow only on dry, well drained, gravelly soil why they so rarely appear in cultivation.  Several species can be recommended for regions with warm and dry climates (zones 6, 7).  Still other species are cold-resistant and can be comfortably grown in zones 4, 5.  A brief list of investigated species follows and includes their Latin names, plant height during flowering (in cm), flower color and month of flowering in nature.  Cold-resistant plants are marked by CR.  Low-growing plants grow well in rock gardens, tall-growing species can be used in flower beds.  All species are unknown in cultivation except <i>A. onobrychis</i>.<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\nFabaceae (Leguminosae)\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242306348\"><i><b>A. aksuensis</b></i> Bunge</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242306354\"><i><b>A. alopecias</b></i> Pall.\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442391\"><i><b>A. brachypus</b></i> Schrenk.\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442392\"><i><b>A. brachytropis</b></i> (Steven) C. A. Mey</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442393\"><i><b>A. brevifolius</b></i>  Ledeb.</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442394\"><i><b>A. cancellatus</b></i> Bunge</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442395\"><i><b>A. caraganae</b></i> Fisch. et C. A. Mey.</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442396\"><i><b>A. ciceroides</b></i> Sosn.</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442397\"><i><b>A. cornutus</b></i> Pall.</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242306471\"><i><b>A. dilutus</b></i> Bunge</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442398\"><i><b>A. dolichophyllus</b></i> Pall.</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442399\"><i><b>A. finitimus</b></i> Bunge</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442400\"><i><b>A. glycyphyllos</b></i> L.</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442401\"><i><b>A. lunatus</b></i> Pall.</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442432\"><i><b>A. maximus</b></i> Willd.</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442433\"><i><b>A. mesites</b></i> Boiss. et  Buhse</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=200011902\"><i><b>A. mongholicus</b></i> Bunge</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442434\"><i><b>A. onobrychis</b></i> L.</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442435\"><i><b>A. perrarus</b></i> Boriss.</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442436\"><i><b>A. polygala</b></i> Pall.</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442437\"><i><b>A. regelii</b></i> Trautv.</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442438\"><i><b>A. rubtzovii</b></i> Boriss.</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242306766\"><i><b>A. sieversianus</b></i> Pall.</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442439\"><i><b>A. sphaerocephalus</b></i> Steven et C.A Mey.</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242442440\"><i><b>A. suffruticosus</b></i> DC.</a>\r\n<li><a href=\"http://www.efloras.org/florataxon.aspx?flora_id=120&taxon_id=242306852\"><i><b>A. vulpinus</b></i> Willd.</a>\r\n</ul><p>\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<P>\r\n</span>\r\n                        <P><!-- Key -->\r\n                        </P> \r\n                        <P>\r\n                          <span id=\"lblLowerTaxonList\"><li name='liLinkToLowerList'><A HREF='browse.aspx?flora_id=120&start_taxon_id=102978'  TARGET='_top' \n\tTITLE='lower taxa' >List of lower taxa</A> \n</span></P>\r\n                        <BR clear=\"all\">\r\n                        <P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n                        <table id=\"tableObjectList\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" width=\"100%\" border=\"1\">\r\n\t\t<tr bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\">\r\n\t\t\t<TD>\r\n                              <TABLE cellSpacing=\"0\" cellPadding=\"0\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\">\r\n                                <TR>\r\n                                  <TD>\r\n                                    <span id=\"Label1\"><font size=\"2\">\r\n                                      <b>Related Objects</b>\r\n                                    </font></span></TD>\r\n                                  <TD align=\"right\">\r\n                                    <span id=\"lblGalleryLink\"><font size=\"1\"></font></span>&nbsp;</TD>\r\n                                </TR>\r\n                              </TABLE>\r\n                            </TD>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<TD>\r\n                              <span id=\"lblObjectList\"><T